{"step_index":846,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T01:59:00Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Activity 1**\n\nOkay, I've started examining the `index.html` file, specifically the runtime logic for Activity 1. I'm currently focused on the `bindActivity1()` function and how it uses `querySelectorAll` with `data-*` attributes. I'll need to understand how these selections are used to interact with the DOM and bind event handlers for Activity 1. My goal is to grasp the flow of control and data binding within this part of the application.\n\n\n**Revising Outfit Logic**\n\nI've been going through the clothing selection event handlers. I see a `clothing-item=\"true\"` attribute being used with `querySelectorAll`. Clicking elements with `data-fit` triggers certain actions. I've noted the 'soft' check and how different types of clothing are selected based on the data attributes. The current outfit selection logic is quite rigid and requires refactoring to support a range of assets and outfit selections. I am now looking at the bin rendering logic to check how the outfits get applied to the character sprite.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Cập nhật renderBinCharacterOutfit dùng đúng các sprite Bé Bin hoàn chỉnh không ghép icon vỡ tỉ lệ","EndLine":480,"Instruction":"Thay thế ensureBinRenderer, setOutfitLayer và bindActivity1 trong index.html","ReplacementContent":"  // ---- Level 1 character renderer ----\n  function renderBinCharacterOutfit() {\n    const mount = el('bin-character-mount-lvl1');\n    if (!mount) return;\n\n    let src = 'assets/characters/bin/bin_base_neutral.svg';\n    if (state.outfit.shirt && state.outfit.pants && state.outfit.shoes) {\n      src = 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants_shoes.svg';\n    } else if (state.outfit.shirt && state.outfit.pants) {\n      src = 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants.svg';\n    } else if (state.outfit.shirt) {\n      src = 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_only.svg';\n    } else if (state.outfit.pants) {\n      src = 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants.svg';\n    } else if (state.outfit.shoes) {\n      src = 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants_shoes.svg';\n    }\n\n    mount.innerHTML = `<img id=\"runtime-bin-full\" src=\"${src}\" alt=\"Bé Bin\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15));\">`;\n  }\n\n  function ensureBinRenderer() {\n    renderBinCharacterOutfit();\n  }\n\n  // ---- Activity 1 ----\n  function bindActivity1() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('#act-1 [data-clothing-item=\"true\"]').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const fit = btn.dataset.fit;\n        const typeRaw = btn.dataset.type;\n        if (fit !== 'soft') {\n          sfx.bad();\n          showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Món này hơi bất tiện. Con thử món khác nhé!');\n          return;\n        }\n        const type = typeRaw === 'shirt' ? 'shirt' : typeRaw === 'pants' ? 'pants' : typeRaw === 'shoes' ? 'shoes' : null;\n        if (!type) return;\n        state.outfit[type] = true;\n        renderBinCharacterOutfit();\n        btn.classList.add('runtime-selected');\n        sfx.good();\n        showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Đúng rồi! Món này mềm và dễ vận động.');\n        if (state.outfit.shirt && state.outfit.pants && state.outfit.shoes) {\n          completeActivity(1);\n          showFeedback(1);\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  }","StartLine":410,"TargetContent":"  // ---- Level 1 character renderer ----\n  const baseCandidates = [\n    'assets/characters/bin/bin_base_neutral.svg',\n    'assets/characters/bin/bin_base.svg',\n    'assets/characters/bin/bin_base.svg'\n  ];\n  function loadFirstWorking(img, candidates, idx=0) {\n    if (idx >= candidates.length) {\n      const box = document.createElement('div');\n      box.className = 'asset-load-error';\n      box.textContent = 'Thiếu artwork Bé Bin trong assets/characters/bin/. App vẫn mở được nhưng cần bổ sung asset nhân vật.';\n      img.replaceWith(box);\n      return;\n    }\n    img.onerror = () => loadFirstWorking(img, candidates, idx+1);\n    img.src = candidates[idx];\n  }\n  function ensureBinRenderer() {\n    const mount = el('bin-character-mount-lvl1');\n    if (!mount || mount.dataset.runtimeReady === '1') return;\n    mount.dataset.runtimeReady = '1';\n    mount.innerHTML = '';\n\n    const base = document.createElement('img');\n    base.className = 'bin-runtime-base';\n    base.alt = 'Bé Bin';\n    mount.appendChild(base);\n    loadFirstWorking(base, baseCandidates);\n\n    ['shirt','pants','shoes'].forEach(type => {\n      const layer = document.createElement('img');\n      layer.id = `runtime-bin-${type}`;\n      layer.className = `bin-runtime-layer ${type}`;\n      layer.alt = '';\n      layer.style.display = 'none';\n      mount.appendChild(layer);\n    });\n  }\n  function setOutfitLayer(type, src) {\n    const layer = el(`runtime-bin-${type}`);\n    if (!layer) return;\n    layer.src = src;\n    layer.style.display = 'block';\n    state.outfit[type] = src;\n  }\n\n  // ---- Activity 1 ----\n  function bindActivity1() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('#act-1 [data-clothing-item=\"true\"]').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const fit = btn.dataset.fit;\n        const typeRaw = btn.dataset.type;\n        if (fit !== 'soft') {\n          sfx.bad();\n          showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Món này hơi bất tiện. Con thử món khác nhé!');\n          return;\n        }\n        const type = typeRaw === 'shirt' ? 'shirt' : typeRaw === 'pants' ? 'pants' : typeRaw === 'shoes' ? 'shoes' : null;\n        if (!type) return;\n        const img = btn.querySelector('img');\n        if (!img) return;\n        setOutfitLayer(type, img.getAttribute('src'));\n        btn.classList.add('runtime-selected');\n        sfx.good();\n        showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Đúng rồi! Món này mềm và dễ vận động.');\n        if (state.outfit.shirt && state.outfit.pants && state.outfit.shoes) {\n          completeActivity(1);\n          showFeedback(1);\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  }","TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\index.html","toolAction":"Editing file","toolSummary":"Fix character renderer in index.html"}}]}
